sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuario
    participant DOC as Documento (ventas/compras/POS)
    participant API as Banks Controller (/treasury/banks/*)
    participant SVC as banksService / banksMovementsService
    participant AUD as banksAuditService
    participant DB as Esquema "Treasury" (PostgreSQL)

    U->>DOC: Confirma documento
    DOC->>API: UMJP (operation=create, idempotency_key, details[])
    API->>SVC: withTransaction(normaliza UMJP)
    alt idempotency_key ya registrada
        SVC-->>API: no duplica (devuelve existente)
    else nueva
        SVC->>DB: INSERT bank_transactions + details (currency, direction)
        SVC->>AUD: registra acción
        AUD->>DB: INSERT bank_audit (append-only)
        DB-->>SVC: commit
    end
    API-->>DOC: OK (saldo por moneda recalculado)

    Note over API,DB: Deshacer = operation "reverse": detalles inversos + reverses_detail_id. No borra; el saldo se recompone.
